hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1497","Malik spoke to me about a man who wrote a kitaba for his slave for gold or silver and stipulated against him in his kitaba a journey"
"1498","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"1499","Malik said"
"1607","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr"
"1608","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Abu Hurayra said"
"1609","Malik related to me from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Ata ibn Yasar that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari found some boys who had driven a fox into a corner"
"1610","Yahya related to me from Malik from a man who said"
"1611","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1612","Malik said that Yahya ibn Said had related to him that A'isha said that Amir ibn Fuhayra had said at the time of the epidemic"
"1613","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nuaym ibn Abdullah al-Mujmir that Abu Hurayra said"
"1614","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim that he heard Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz say"